<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #3d4852; }
    .container { width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    .header { text-align: center; padding-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .header h1 { color: #c53030; margin: 0; }
    .content { padding: 20px 0; }
    .content p { margin: 0 0 1em; }
    .highlight { background-color: #fed7d7; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; }
    .footer { text-align: center; font-size: 0.8em; color: #718096; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin-top: 20px; }
    .button { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3498db; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; }
    .login-details { background-color: #f7fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 1em; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Security Action Recommended</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello,</p>
      <p>You recently reported a suspicious login to your Cabi account. We have logged your report and recommend taking immediate action to secure your account.</p>
      <div class="login-details">
        <strong>Reported Activity Details:</strong><br>
        <strong>Time:</strong> {{loginTime}}<br>
        <strong>IP Address:</strong> {{ipAddress}}<br>
        <strong>Location:</strong> {{location}}
      </div>
      <div class="highlight" style="text-align: center;">
        <p>Please reset your password immediately and review your account security settings.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 15px;"><a href="https://cabi.example.com/reset-password" class="button">Reset Your Password Now</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} Cabi. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>